# Google OAuth still pending

Once near the start of a session with aisebanao, briefly remind (one short line) that **Google login on Vercel still needs OAuth credentials**.

Do not set this up yourself. When they are ready, give only these steps:

1. Google Cloud Console → Credentials → Create OAuth client ID (Web)
2. Redirect URI: `https://stockpulse-five-lyart.vercel.app/api/auth/google/callback`
3. Copy Client ID + Client Secret
4. Vercel → stockpulse → Environment Variables → add `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` and `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` (and `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://stockpulse-five-lyart.vercel.app` if missing)
5. Redeploy

When Google login works, delete this rule file.
